<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>New Order</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px;">
    <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <h2 style="color: #333333;">You have a new order!</h2>

          <p style="color: #555555;">Hi <%= sellerName %>,</p>

          <p style="color: #555555;">
            A buyer has placed an order on your listing. Please review the details below and confirm you can fulfill it.
          </p>

          <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="8" style="margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 4px;">
            <tr style="background-color: #f9f9f9;">
              <td style="color: #888888; font-size: 13px;">Order ID</td>
              <td style="color: #333333; font-weight: bold;"><%= orderNumber %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="color: #888888; font-size: 13px;">Item</td>
              <td style="color: #333333;"><%= listingTitle %></td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="background-color: #f9f9f9;">
              <td style="color: #888888; font-size: 13px;">Amount</td>
              <td style="color: #333333; font-weight: bold;">₦<%= amount %></td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <p style="color: #d97706; font-weight: bold;">
            ⏳ You have 72 hours to click "I'm Ready" and set delivery details, or the order will be automatically cancelled.
          </p>

          <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 12px;">
            If you cannot fulfill this order, you can cancel it from your dashboard.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
